; kilim.websocket.browser: the driver of kilim.websocket on the WebSocket API
; of the browser, with Brr_io.Websocket. main.ml calls
; Kilim_websocket_browser.install (). It uses none of Printf, Format, Scanf,
; Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or Printexc (test/link). windtrap runs only native
; code, thus test/dom/guards.txt lists the guards of this library with their
; tests.

(library
 (name kilim_websocket_browser)
 (public_name kilim.websocket.browser)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim kilim.websocket brr))
